 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Rockstar may have shown us GTA 6 back in 2021."
  },
  {
   "text": "Remember the San Andreas remaster? A framed picture hung on a bar wall."
  },
  {
   "text": "Fans always said it looked like a leaked GTA 6 screenshot."
  },
  {
   "text": "Now players say they found that exact house in Leonida."
  },
  {
   "text": "Same garage, same palm trees, even the bushes match."
  },
  {
   "text": "It sits in Belville, and the GTA Wiki mapping project found it."
  },
  {
   "text": "One outlet says the new version has far more detail."
  },
  {
   "text": "Rockstar has not said a word."
  },
  {
   "text": "So was it a secret teaser, or just a lucky coincidence? Tell us below, do you think"
  }
 ],
